                <pb facs="0158" n="50" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg50"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No 11—Translation—Extract from the
                        Jornal de Comercio—Telegrams.]</seg></opener>
                <p>The Diario Oficial to-day published the following declaration:</p>
                <p>In order to facilitate communications of purely business matters, the Government
                    has resolved to permit the banks of this place to transmit telegrams relative to
                    their transactions, with the understanding that they shall be visaed by the
                    minister of the treasury.</p>
            </div>
